OL,3,GNEWSAMum's says painful condition
OL,4,A'overlooked' during pregnancy
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mum who suffered from pre-eclampsia
OL,7,Fduring pregnancy said she felt her
OL,8,Fsymptoms were "overlooked" due to her
OL,9,Funderlying sickle cell disease.
OL,11,FGrace, 28, from Manchester, was in her
OL,12,Fsecond trimester when she started
OL,13,Fnoticing how "physically taxing" her
OL,14,Fpregnancy had become including "extreme
OL,15,Fpain".
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
