OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F408A1787549229
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMum's says painful condition
OL,4,A'overlooked' during pregnancy
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was only when she was admitted to St
OL,7,FMary's Hospital in Manchester with a
OL,8,Fsickle cell disease (SCD) unit that she
OL,9,Fwas diagnosed with pre-eclampsia, a
OL,10,Fpregnancy-related condition that can
OL,11,Fcause high blood pressure, and went on
OL,12,Fto have an emergency Caesarean.
OL,14,FShe has called for urgent research and
OL,15,Fmore awareness of SCD so people do not
OL,16,Fsuffer the same trauma ordeal she did.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
